   <section className="panel"><h3>Catalog completeness</h3><p className="muted">Profiles missing a poster, core metadata, production details, cast, or synopsis.</p><strong className="catalog-health-count">{movieCounts.incomplete} <span>of {movieCounts.total} movie profiles incomplete</span></strong><div className="quick-actions"><Link className="button secondary" to="/admin/movies"><Film size={17}/> Review movie catalog</Link><Link className="button secondary" to="/admin/movies/new"><Plus size={17}/> Add a movie</Link></div></section>
